From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:52:42 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 054/207] DeepSeek V4.1 serving: TF_DSV41_RUNNER opens the
 in-model runner; chats run their cells

The engine loads the circuit file and its CPU backend; the server gives the
runner its tokenizer (token bytes once, plain encoding of results) and sets
run_cells on chat requests while the runner is on. Needs the frontend
(core/runner_frontend.zig) from the frontend track to build.
